<div class="ft-prose">
    <h2>Control Your Money</h2>

    <p>Money is hard. You have it, then you don't have it.</p>

    <p>Where does it come from?</p>

    <p>More importantly: where does it go?</p>

    <p>The answers seem easy. But...</p>

    <p>Where <em>does</em> the money go?</p>

    <p><em>What do I have to show for it?</em></p>

    <p>
        I asked myself these questions for far too long. I finally took action.
    </p>

    <p>
        What I'm sharing here is not anything special or even especially difficult.
        It's a simple way of thinking about your income and spending that empowers
        you to take control.
    </p>

    <p><em>You can do this.</em></p>

    <a href="footing-me" class="btn btn-primary">Get Your Footing</a>
</div>
